{
  "sn45.180:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.180 ",
  "sn45.180:0.2": "14. Oghavagga ",
  "sn45.180:0.3": "Uddhambhāgiyasutta ",
  "sn45.180:1.1": "“Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, uddhambhāgiyāni saṁyojanāni. ",
  "sn45.180:1.2": "Katamāni pañca? ",
  "sn45.180:1.3": "Rūparāgo, arūparāgo, māno, uddhaccaṁ, avijjā—",
  "sn45.180:1.4": "imāni kho, bhikkhave, pañcuddhambhāgiyāni saṁyojanāni. ",
  "sn45.180:1.5": "Imesaṁ kho, bhikkhave, pañcannaṁ uddhambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabbo. ",
  "sn45.180:1.6": "Katamo ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo? ",
  "sn45.180:1.7": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sammādiṭṭhiṁ bhāveti vivekanissitaṁ …pe… sammāsamādhiṁ bhāveti vivekanissitaṁ virāganissitaṁ nirodhanissitaṁ vossaggapariṇāmiṁ. ",
  "sn45.180:1.8": "Imesaṁ kho, bhikkhave, pañcannaṁ uddhambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya ayaṁ ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabboti. ",
  "sn45.180:2.1": "Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, uddhambhāgiyāni saṁyojanāni. ",
  "sn45.180:2.2": "Katamāni pañca? ",
  "sn45.180:2.3": "Rūparāgo, arūparāgo, māno, uddhaccaṁ, avijjā—",
  "sn45.180:2.4": "imāni kho, bhikkhave, pañcuddhambhāgiyāni saṁyojanāni. ",
  "sn45.180:2.5": "Imesaṁ kho, bhikkhave, pañcannaṁ uddhambhāgiyānaṁ saṁyojanānaṁ abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetab